    "text": "{\n  \"semantic_type\": \"flow\",\n  \"unit\": \"USD\",\n  \"additive_over_entities\": true,\n  \"additive_over_time\": false,\n  \"time_rollup\": \"reported_fy_value\",\n  \"valid_methods\": [\"sum_across_entities\"],\n  \"period_basis\": \"mixed\",\n  \"derivation\": \"Reported XBRL value of NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities, or the ...ContinuingOperations variant for DRI. Quarterly rows cover a single quarter. Later rows are cumulative year-to-date (YTD6, YTD9) or full fiscal year (FY), so rows for the same fiscal year overlap and must not be summed over time.\",\n  \"calendar\": \"fiscal\",\n  \"seasonal_adjustment\": null,\n  \"annualized\": false,\n  \"entity_grain\": \"company (ticker/cik)\",\n  \"hierarchy\": null,\n  \"comparability\": \"by_definition_id\",\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"source\": \"SEC EDGAR XBRL company facts\",\n    \"url_template\": \"https://data.sec.gov/api/xbrl/companyfacts/CIK{cik}.json\",\n    \"retrieved_on\": \"2026-10-24\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Net cash provided by (used in) operating activities, in USD, for restaurant companies (CMG, WING, YUM, DRI) as reported in SEC 10-Q and 10-K filings. Each row's period_basis (Q, YTD6, YTD9, FY) shows whether it covers a quarter, a cumulative year-to-date span, or a full fiscal year. Annual totals should use the reported FY value rather than a sum of rows. Fiscal calendars differ across companies, and the XBRL concept differs for DRI (continuing operations).\"\n}",
